---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | Japanerary">
    <div class="flex justify-center my-6 px-10">
        <div class="md:w-2/3">
            <h1 class="text-4xl text-center font-bold mb-6">About</h1>
            
            <section id="about-summary-section" class="my-6">
                <p class="my-6">Hello, I’m the developer behind this website.</p>
                <p class="my-6">I’m a full-stack developer with an interest in travel (especially to Japan). I’ve visited twice so far and plan to return many more times.</p>
                <p class="my-6">I tend to obsessively research anything I’m interested in. Through this and my travel experience, I’ve gathered a lot of useful information. While planning my own trips, I often found myself piecing together details from dozens of articles, videos, and reddit threads.</p>
                <p class="my-6">This site exists because I wanted a single place with solid, easy to digest information for Japan travel.</p>
                <p class="my-6">If you have feedback or questions, feel free to reach out at the socials listed below.</p>
                <p class="my-6">I hope that you are able to learn something cool, and I hope you have a great time. Cheers.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
